<title>USA: Panda reaches agreement with LG Cable.</title>
<headline>Panda reaches agreement with LG Cable.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panda Project Inc said Friday it reached an agreement with LG Cable Co.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, LG Cable will manufacture and sell the advanced Compass Series interconnect technology developed by Panda Project.</p>
<p>The license fee is in excess of $1.0 million plus royalties based on sales, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
